!!! tip "Number-only questions might route to Genie Agent"
    Questions like "{{ t1.question_short | default(t1.question) }}" that ask only for numbers might be routed by Genie One to the Genie Agent you created in Step 4, which shows the Genie Agent link as source instead of Pages. Including a definition request together makes it easier to see Pages as sources.

!!! info "Multiple Pages in shared workspace"
    If you practice in a shared workspace, other practitioners' {{ s.lab.company }}-related Pages might appear as sources. Verify the Pages belong to your Domain (`{{ cat }}`).

